   ------------------------------
   Installed into the APK as jniLibs libandroid-shmem.so (0.7, aarch64,
   from the Termux package repository); it implements the SysV shm
   interface over Android's ashmem and is a runtime dependency of proot.

   Source code: https://github.com/termux/libandroid-shmem

